# Fleet Management System – Third-party Integrations, API Gateway
# Author : Ashfaaq Feroz Muhammad | BITS ID: 2023EBCS005
# Course : Backend and API Development – BITS Pilani
# File   : demo.http – VS Code "REST Client" walkthrough (click "Send Request" above each block)

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = devkey123

### 1. Gateway health (no API key)
GET {{gateway}}/health

### 2. Login as admin
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/api/users/login
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@fleet.local", "password": "Admin@123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Register a vehicle by address (geocoded with OpenStreetMap)
# @name created
POST {{gateway}}/api/vehicles
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "registrationNumber": "KL-07-RC-1001", "make": "Tata", "model": "Intra V30", "type": "truck", "address": "Marine Drive, Kochi" }

###
@vehicleId = {{created.response.body.vehicle.id}}

### 4. Send telemetry
POST {{gateway}}/api/telemetry
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}", "lat": 9.9816, "lng": 76.2999, "speed": 38, "fuelLevel": 64, "batteryVoltage": 12.7, "engineTemp": 86 }

### 5. Nearby vehicles within 3 km
GET {{gateway}}/api/vehicles/nearby?lat=9.9816&lng=76.2999&radiusKm=3
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Critical event – low battery → SMS to admins
POST {{gateway}}/api/telemetry
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}", "lat": 9.9816, "lng": 76.2999, "speed": 0, "batteryVoltage": 11.1, "engineTemp": 84 }

### 7. Status change → SMS to admins, managers, driver
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/status
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "maintenance", "reason": "Scheduled brake inspection" }

### 8. Manual SMS to a number that always fails (ends in 0000)
POST {{gateway}}/api/notifications/sms
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "+919800000000", "message": "This SMS will fail on purpose" }

### 9. Notifications list and stats
GET {{gateway}}/api/notifications?limit=5
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/notifications/stats
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Missing API key → 401
GET {{gateway}}/api/vehicles

### 11. Wrong API key → 403
GET {{gateway}}/api/vehicles
x-api-key: wrong-key

### 12. Unknown route → 404
GET {{gateway}}/api/spaceships
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
